{"id": 10013159, "reference": "A12/01488/24", "publication_date": "2024-06-03T07:36:57.423Z", "modification_date": "2024-06-03T07:36:57.426Z", "country": "Sweden", "product_category": "ELECTRICAL_APPLIANCES", "product_name": "LED headlamp", "product_name_specific": "LED Waterproof head band lamp orange", "risk_description": "The plastic material of the cable has excessive concentrations of bis(2-ethylhexyl) phthalate (DEHP), diisobutyl phthalate (DIBP), lead and short chain chlorinated paraffins (SCCPs) (measured values: 1.9%, 0.15%, 0.13% and 3.5% by weight, respectively).\nThe solders in the product have an excessive concentration of lead (measured value up to 72.6% by weight).\nDEHP and DIPB may harm the health by causing possible damage to the reproductive system. DIPB may further harm the health of children. \nLead poses a risk to the environment.\nSCCPs persist in the environment, are toxic to aquatic organisms at low concentrations and bio-accumulate in wildlife and humans, posing a risk to human health and the environment. Prolonged exposure to them through the skin may cause cancer.", "legal_provision": "The product does not comply with the requirements of the Directive on the restriction of the use of certain hazardous substances in electrical and electronic equipment (RoHS 2 Directive) nor with the Persistent Organic Pollutants (POP) Regulation.", "country_of_origin": "People's Republic of China", "sold_online": "YES", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["Not specified"], "model_types": ["EC21820-CO12"], "risk_types": ["CHEMICAL", "ENVIRONMENT"], "measures": ["BAN_MARKETING_OF_PRODUCT"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10124063, "main": true, "embedding": ""}, {"photo_id": 10124064, "main": false, "embedding": ""}]}